      "title": "Add Support for Reporting Ranges",
      "url": "https://github.com/commonsensesoftware/partial-content-uploads/pull/4",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "commonsensesoftware",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "This PR makes a several minor enhancements and one new operation to the specification.\r\n\r\n### Enhancements\r\n\r\n- Fix grammatical errors\r\n- Use consistent casing for RFC 2119 words\r\n- Use `upload` versus `transfer` to match the spec title\r\n- Cite the _Fetch Standard_ spec in the informative references\r\n- Use `422` instead of `400` when appropriate\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n\r\n- Add support for a server to report the previously sent content via a `HEAD` request and the `Range` header field",
